00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.980
Return to your seats, we have just been cleared to land.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.350
What do you mean we've been red flagged?

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.840
I am sorry. Your entry visas have been cancelled.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.830
