00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:57.230
Konichiwa. I believe someone wishes to speak with you.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:03:59.180
Yes.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.510
Yes, sir. I'm sorry, sir. At once, sir.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:07.960
Welcome to Japan.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.040
